cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "zotero-native-mcp: an MCP server for Zotero 10+ over its native local API"
abstract: >-
  An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that reads and writes a Zotero 10+
  library entirely offline through Zotero's native local API, with no Zotero
  plugin, no zotero.org API key and no cloud round trip. It lets AI assistants
  search a library, read PDF full text, create collections, add references and
  attach local PDFs.
